 "1412875633931540", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1412875637264873_6293214463016266479_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ebTgVAjJCUgQ7kNvwHZ99mt&_nc_oc=AdoEbFi_x93bwsub8cDQdgs92JcCdtXis7T4XXPsJtjkGv2pe9xKreyH8OMu3V2SmBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP7SQ288N4xnqEUZCmDmSm7RwgPBWNwyIE5flNCV4kCIw&oe=6AE1EB19"}, "display_name": "Nightmare Tag", "keywords": ["Multiplayer", "horror", "pvp", "tag", "backrooms"], "long_description": "Nightmare Tag is a multiplayer VR horror game set within the eerie, liminal spaces of your nightmares.\n\nBECOME THE NIGHTMARE\nPlay as 3 monsters, each with 4 upgradable perks and a unique, physics-based motion mechanic:\n- Entity: Wield terrifying speed and agility\n- Mimic: Track voices and shapeshift into humans\n- Crow: Stalk and ambush humans by changing your size from tiny to colossal\n\nSURVIVE THE NIGHTMARE\nPlay as 4 unique humans, each with 4 upgradable perks:\n- Characters: Antonio (teamwork), Charles (teleport), Madison (medic), Sadie (athlete)\n- Slingshot: Stun monsters with heated pellets and adapt your strategy with attachments like Laser Beam, Boom Blast, Warp Shot, and Portal Pellet\n- Scanner: Detect teammates, threats, attachments, and objectives through walls\n- Run: Combine joystick movement with controller motion to sprint through the nightmare\n- Hide: Turn invisible by standing completely motionless\n- Climb: Grab onto nearly any surface to climb, vault, and outmaneuver monsters\n\nCO-OP & MULTIPLAYER\n- Nightmare Tag (PvP): 2\u201310 players hunt each other in 3 unique game modes including Quick Tag, VHS Run, and Elimination\n- Nightmare Run (PvE): 1\u20138 players ascend an expanding dream world by completing objectives and scanning creatures to uncover their behavior\n\nDEMO VS FULL GAME\nPlay for Free:\n- Play as Antonio or the Entity\n- Earn XP and upgrade perks\n- Join any lobby\n\nGeneral Admission ($10):\n- Unlock new characters with XP\n- Host PvE lobbies\n- +3000 Tokens", "short_description": "Nightmare Tag is a thrilling VR horror game that takes place in your nightmares! Scare your friends as a monster with abilities designed to hunt, or survive as a human in fast-paced PvP & PvE game modes. Decide fight or flight quickly! Fight back with a modifiable slingshot, or break line of sight and stand completely still to go invisible! Play for free as Antonio or the Entity. Buy General Admission to unlock the full game with more characters, upgradable perks, and PvE lobby hosting."}]}, "developer_name": "Grounded", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digital-kyle.github.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Grounded", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://digital-kyle.github.io/nightmare-tag/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["HORROR", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "29077132715306836"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_2434144410332182_4281215840415307216_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KNf2H-sdLbQQ7kNvwFm6ZWi&_nc_oc=Adp8KN1nf75wEI75X-jP9yFDltqq0m2u81nZ-fhhl_HmoVs8WLML4EufIJt4SGvS8WI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.co